---
title: SwiftDrop - Courier status update triggers notifications (Role 4 + Role 6)
---
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Courier
    participant UI as Courier phone UI
    participant GW as api-gateway
    participant DISP as dispatch-service
    participant S3 as MinIO (delivery-proofs)
    participant PARCEL as parcel-service
    participant MQ as RabbitMQ (parcel.events)
    participant NOTIF as notification-service
    actor Customer

    Courier->>UI: Choose new status, note, optional photo
    UI->>GW: POST /api/v1/courier/deliveries/{id}/status<br/>Bearer JWT, multipart
    GW->>GW: Verify JWT (JWKS)
    GW->>DISP: Forward request
    DISP->>DISP: @PreAuthorize COURIER<br/>check assignment.courier = caller

    alt Assignment belongs to another courier
        DISP-->>GW: 403 ProblemDetail
        GW-->>UI: 403 Forbidden
    else FAILED without a reason
        DISP-->>GW: 400 ProblemDetail
        GW-->>UI: 400 Validation error
    else Valid request
        opt Photo attached
            DISP->>S3: PUT object (generated key)
            S3-->>DISP: object_key
        end
        DISP->>PARCEL: PATCH /internal/parcels/{parcelId}/status<br/>toStatus, note, proofRef
        PARCEL->>PARCEL: State machine validates transition

        alt Transition not allowed
            PARCEL-->>DISP: 409 Conflict
            DISP-->>GW: 409 ProblemDetail
            GW-->>UI: 409 Conflict
        else Transition allowed
            Note over PARCEL: One transaction:<br/>update parcel + status history + outbox row
            PARCEL-->>DISP: 200 OK
            DISP->>DISP: Save delivery_proof,<br/>update assignment status
            DISP-->>GW: 200 OK
            GW-->>UI: 200 Updated delivery

            Note over PARCEL,MQ: Asynchronous from here
            PARCEL->>MQ: Outbox relay publishes ParcelStatusChanged v1<br/>routing key parcel.status.<status>
            par notification.q and webhook.q
                MQ-)NOTIF: Deliver event
                NOTIF->>NOTIF: Skip if eventId already processed
                NOTIF-)Customer: Email (SMS for OUT_FOR_DELIVERY, DELIVERED, FAILED)
                NOTIF->>NOTIF: Signed webhook to merchant, retry on failure
            and dispatch.q
                MQ-)DISP: Deliver event
                DISP->>DISP: Skip if eventId in processed_events,<br/>else increment daily_stats
            and tracking.q
                MQ-)PARCEL: Deliver event
                PARCEL-)Customer: SSE push to open tracking page
            end
        end
    end
